This repository is published under three licences, because it holds
three kinds of thing. There is no single licence text here, and a file
called LICENSE that named only one of them would be wrong about the
other two.

    Hardware sources           CERN-OHL-W-2.0   LICENSES/CERN-OHL-W-2.0.txt
    Software and tooling       Apache-2.0       LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt
    Documents and data         CC-BY-4.0        LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt

Every source file carries an SPDX-License-Identifier tag saying which of
these applies to it. Files that cannot carry a comment -- JSON, CSV,
Markdown -- are covered by path in .reuse/dep5. LICENSES.md is the map
in prose, and scripts/spdx_check.py is the same map as a program: it
fails if any source file is untagged or tagged against policy.

Two files are under a licence this project did not choose:
hw/soc/rvformal/insns/insn_div.v and insn_rem.v are corrected copies of
riscv-formal's instruction models and carry upstream's ISC notice inline
(LICENSES/ISC.txt).

The decision behind all of this, including what was considered and
rejected, is docs/14-licensing-decision.md, signed 2026-09-09.

